    TODO-0001: count everyone under a manager's managers
    
    A manager's managers have reports of their own, so their loop can't
    read a salary or add 1 the way the loops for every other role do: it
    has to ask that manager for its own total, which recurses down the tree.
    
    Each operation now has five loops: one for managers, which recurses,
    and four for the other roles, which are identical except for which
    array they read.

